{"id":51727,"date":"2026-06-19T06:17:27","date_gmt":"2026-06-19T05:17:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51727"},"modified":"2026-09-02T20:16:17","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:16:17","slug":"poiares-adventure-race","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/poiares-adventure-race\/","title":{"rendered":"Poiares Adventure Race 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Poiares Adventure Race 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026 do <strong>Poiares Adventure Race<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>26 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com centro nevr\u00e1lgico no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa de S. Miguel (ARSM)<\/strong>, em <strong>Vila Nova de Poiares<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Organizada pela conceituada equipa da <strong>ARSM<\/strong> com apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Vila Nova de Poiares<\/strong> e cronometragem <strong>Stop and Go<\/strong>, a prova desafia equipas em duplas num emocionante formato multidesportivo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> e combina de forma cont\u00ednua tr\u00eas sectores espetaculares: <strong>3,5 km de Canoagem\/Kayak<\/strong> em \u00e1guas fluviais, <strong>12 km de Trail Running<\/strong> por trilhos t\u00e9cnicos e c\u00e9nicos da serra, e <strong>25 km de BTT<\/strong> por estrad\u00f5es e veredas do concelho poiarense, testando a resist\u00eancia, esp\u00edrito de entreajuda e navega\u00e7\u00e3o das duplas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o ARSM (S\u00e3o Miguel), Vila Nova de Poiares, Coimbra<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Prova Combinada em Duplas: Kayak 3,5 km + Trail Running 12 km + BTT 25 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa de S. Miguel (ARSM) \/ Munic\u00edpio de Vila Nova de Poiares<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Aventura<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Poiares Adventure Race (Duplas)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Poiares Adventure Race 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de setembro de 2026, com partida e centro de opera\u00e7\u00f5es no Pavilh\u00e3o da ARSM em S\u00e3o Miguel, Vila Nova de Poiares.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o formato de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e disciplinas inclu\u00eddas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A participa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 feita exclusivamente em equipas de duplas, combinando Kayak (3,5 km), Trail Running (12 km) e BTT (25 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o fornece as embarca\u00e7\u00f5es de kayak?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, os kayaks e pagaia s\u00e3o assegurados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o na zona de transi\u00e7\u00e3o aqu\u00e1tica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O percurso \u00e9 balizado ou requer orienta\u00e7\u00e3o por GPS?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 devidamente sinalizado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o com postos de controlo eletr\u00f3nico e apoio ao longo de todos os sectores.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial da dupla?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma Stop and Go at\u00e9 ao encerramento dos prazos regulamentares.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Poiares Adventure Race 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o ARSM (S\u00e3o Miguel), Vila Nova de Poiares\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Poiares\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa de S. Miguel (ARSM) \/ Munic\u00edpio de Vila Nova de Poiares\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Poiares Adventure Race 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de setembro de 2026, com partida e centro de opera\u00e7\u00f5es no Pavilh\u00e3o da ARSM em S\u00e3o Miguel, Vila Nova de Poiares.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o formato de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e disciplinas inclu\u00eddas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A participa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 feita exclusivamente em equipas de duplas, combinando Kayak (3,5 km), Trail Running (12 km) e BTT (25 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o fornece as embarca\u00e7\u00f5es de kayak?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, os kayaks e pagaia s\u00e3o assegurados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o na zona de transi\u00e7\u00e3o aqu\u00e1tica.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O percurso \u00e9 balizado ou requer orienta\u00e7\u00e3o por GPS?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 devidamente sinalizado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o com postos de controlo eletr\u00f3nico e apoio ao longo de todos os sectores.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial da dupla?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma Stop and Go at\u00e9 ao encerramento dos prazos regulamentares.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51728,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51727","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vila-nova-de-poiares-coimbra","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/up